OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 26 APR
OL,4,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,5,     GJoin Sarah Walker for a wide-
OL,6,     Granging Sunday mix, from vivid
OL,7,     Glandscapes to Nordic choral
OL,8,     Gstillness, colourful orchestral
OL,9,     Gshowpieces and moments of
OL,10,     Greflection.
OL,11,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,12,     GMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,13,     Gchemist Professor Dame Ijeoma
OL,14,     GUchegbu.
OL,15,G1330FMusic Map
OL,16,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch surveys the
OL,17,     Gmusical landscape surrounding JS
OL,18,     GBach's iconic Toccata and Fugue
OL,19,     GBWV 565. This tour-de-force is
OL,20,     Ginstantly recognisable - but is
OL,21,     Git even for organ?
