OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 26 APR
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French is joined by
OL,6,     Gconductor Jeremy Summerly to
OL,7,     Gexplore music associated with the
OL,8,     Gplague - composers who succumbed
OL,9,     Gto the disease and pieces that
OL,10,     Gresponded to great loss.
OL,11,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from the Chapel of Selwyn
OL,13,     GCollege, Cambridge, with music by
OL,14,     GWood, Tamsin Jones and John
OL,15,     GRutter.
OL,16,G1900FSunday Feature: Afterwords
OL,17,     GAn exploration of the trumpet
OL,18,     Gplayer, composer and conductor
OL,19,     GElgar - Gary - Howarth. Musical
OL,20,     Gcolleagues together with his son
OL,21,     GPatrick reflect on his
OL,22,     Ginternational achievements.
